        "id": "valeera",
        "name": "Valeera"
      },
      {
        "id": "zeratul",
        "name": "Zeratul"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "As a frail Ranged Assassin, Falstad tends to naturally struggle against high-damage Heroes who have the ability to effectively gap close past his Barrel Roll's range or otherwise sneak up on him. With little in the way of self-peeling, see to stay near your Healer when possible against such Heroes, and make no bold attempts at outplaying your opponents."
  },
