        "id": "tomb-of-the-spider-queen",
        "name": "Tomb of the Spider Queen"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Flight makes Falstad particularly effective on larger Maps that feature multiple Objectives that must be contested, as it allows him to effectively soak and push without giving up potential team fighting presence, as would other Heroes.\n\nMighty Gust also makes him potent on Maps that feature Bosses, as he makes it particularly difficult for opponents to safely try and claim or contest due to the fear of being knocked away.\n\nOverall, Falstad's versatility makes him a viable pick almost anywhere, but he gives less value on small Maps where it is hard to make good use of its global."
  },
