    {
      "name": "Basic Attacks Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "Falstad's Basic Attacks Build provides a fair amount of sustain damage on a single target thanks to multiple Talents that improve your damage via Basic Attacks: Frequent Flyer at Level 1, Secret Weapon at Level 7, and Sustained Winds at Level 13.\n\nAs this Build gives you access to percent-based damage, it is great for pressuring and/or taking down the enemy frontline, even if they have access to Armor effects.\n\nGiven it does not need to stack on enemy Heroes, this Build is the go-to when you are playing on a big Map (for example Sky Temple) and your strategy revolves around split-pushing to pressure the enemy team.",
